      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Patang is a kite swing set. An arched frame joins four kite sections with a loop climber, and from the front the whole thing reads as one kite. Coloured kite panels catch the light as children swing on the orange seats or climb through the hanging rings. It suits ages 5 to 12. The product area is 14'11\" x 5'9\", but the safe play area is much larger at 24'11\" x 19'9\", because swings need clear space front and back. Swinging, climbing and hanging build arm strength, flexibility and concentration. The colours are multi-colour. Its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts and composite laminates are covered for 3 years. Ask us for a layout that shows the full swing zone."
